# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

lists is project
lists purpose "Fill and read lists of numbers, texts, and records in a region; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
lists target console
lists version "0.1.0"
lists language refined 1
lists standardLibrary 1
lists allows write console.stdout none
lists requires none
lists includesModule lists
lists entry lists.main
